UID:2606262m2nNW27P0qqa-MajuRg_A
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxed evening featuring Roederer Estate\, know
 n for elegant méthode traditionnelle sparkling wines grown in the cool-cl
 imate Anderson Valley. Expect bright bubbles\, fine detail\, and the kind 
 of wines made for lingering conversations.\n\nWe will be spinning vinyl al
 l evening\, setting the tone with warm\, nostalgic sounds that pair perfec
 tly with coastal air and a glass in hand.\n\nSip through a curated selecti
 on of sparkling wines while you settle in for a listening experience desig
 ned for unwinding\, reconnecting\, and enjoying the moment.\n\nThis event 
 is complimentary. Ages 21 and up only.
LOCATION:Sea Ranch Lodge
URL:https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
