DESCRIPTION:Gary & The Igniters play your favorite rock hits at Barrel Pro
 of Lounge in Downtown Santa Rosa. Thursday 7/2\, 8pm. No cover!\n\nGary & 
 The Igniters are a raw\, rockin' rock band capable of performing many sub-
 genres of rock from top 40 type classic radio hits and tasty deep cuts to 
 hard drivin' guitar oriented orignals. The members of the Igniters have sh
 ared stages with many of their classic rock heroes\, like Van Halen\, 38 S
 pecial\, The Guess Who\, Mick Taylor\, Greg Kihn\, Nightranger and more !\
 n\nGary Mobley(Guitar\, lead vox)\, Dan Nelson(drums\, vox) and Rob Ruiz(b
 ass\, vox) create a bigger than trio sound that will get you rockin' with 
 their song catalog versatility\, musicianship and good time vibes.\n\n Th
 ursday\, July 2  8pm  No cover  501 Mendocino Ave\, Downtown Santa R
 osa  21+ Grab a drink\, bring some friends\, and enjoy a night of timele
 ss rock hits in the heart of Downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nCheck out **www.Barre
 lProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/gary-the-igniters-rock-n-roll-favorites-d
 owntown-santa-rosa-tickets-1991604730361?aff=oddtdtcreator
