DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm.\n\nShow from 8:15-10
 :30pm with one intermission\n\nOrion Rush is a multi instrumentalist singe
 r-songwriter blending hard hitting acoustic songs that hold listeners in s
 uspended moments of time with captivating live looping that fuses dance\, 
 goth\, indie\, and experimental textures. Moving between intimacy and chao
 s\, Orion Rush creates immersive performances that can leave audiences bot
 h on the edge of their seat and on their feet. This show marks the debut o
 f a new evolving live experience.\n\nhttps://on.soundcloud.com/nss4fcJX88r
 4w61LXj\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/orionrushmusic\n\nMel Baker provides 
 vocals\, lapsteel\, electric mandolin and gitar for the Psych Rock band SA
 MVEGA\, a "Band of artists\, painters\, builders\, music makers\, merrimen
 t creators\, travelers\, animal lovers\, urban vacationers\, beach combers
 \, rust farmers\, star gazers\, book readers and barn dwellers..." She is 
 a founding member of the art collective The Ehlers Society with her sister
  Mercedes and fellow band members. http://bakersistersart.com/\n\nhttps://
 www.instagram.com/rustyandgorgeous
