BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:regen·era Rising: A Global Confluence for Creators of Regenerativ
 e Futures
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T220000
UID:260627spocjlP3VEOlZooTVuwMfg
DESCRIPTION:The Design Science Studio is an educational and cultural incub
 ator empowering global creators to catalyze regenerative futures through t
 ransdisciplinary projects\, creative interventions and collective practice
 .\n\nAt a historic moment for planetary regeneration and collective imagin
 ation\, the re-emergence of regen·era invites creators from around the wo
 rld into an evolving story-world imagined into being by the Design Science
  Studio.\n\nFor three days\, the village of regen·era docks and roots its
 elf in Hopland\, California among weeping willows and a swimmable pond at 
 Gateway Mendocino. Through immersive camping\, shared regenerative meals a
 nd participatory village life\, participants enter a living experiment in 
 interdependence\, regenerative culture and civic imagination.
LOCATION:Gateway Mendocino
URL:http://bit.ly/regenerarising
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
