DESCRIPTION:**Join the Town of Windsor and the Active 20-30 Club to celebr
 ate our nation’s Independence Day on July 3\, 2026\, at Keiser Park in W
 indsor\, CA!**\n\nCome celebrate Independence Day 2026 in style with the T
 own of Windsor and the Active 20-30 Club at Keiser Park! Get ready for an 
 explosive night of live music\, delicious food\, and endless fun for the w
 hole family. Don't miss out on the must-see fireworks event of the year th
 at directly benefits local children's programs through the Active 20-30 Cl
 ub.\n\n**And it’s all for the kids!** Not only are the fireworks a great
  event for kids of all ages\, but the proceeds of this event will directly
  benefit local children’s programs in partnership with the Active 20-30 
 Club. We hope to see you there!\n\nLive Music by:\n\n**DJ | Dry Creek Stat
 ion | Joose**\n\nBrought to you by the Active 20-30 Club
