DESCRIPTION:Join us for an Edible Garden Tour of The Sea Ranch Lodge Farm 
 gardens\, which lies on a sunny western slope just 2 minutes south of the 
 Lodge. Taste your way through chicories and lettuces\, cherry tomatoes and
  slicers\, ground cherries and pineapple tomatillos\, sugar snap peas and 
 shoots\, and whatever else happens to be ready this month. Participants ge
 t to take home a box of vegetables and fruits they pick themselves.
