BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bayou Moon at Spancky's in Downtown Cotati
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260704T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260704T235900
UID:2606255IVOS1VU70SS64ulbcyIVQ
DESCRIPTION:Bayou Moon\, a high-energy\, professional band\, delivers more
  than just music\, they create an ambience of joy and connection at every 
 show. Blending Southern soul\, New Orleans funk with West Coast grooves\, 
 their sound and stage presence enhance any venue with an uplifting and dyn
 amic performance. From the first downbeat to the final note\, Bayou Moon t
 akes audiences on a musical journey of rhythm\, emotion and fun.\n\nBayou 
 Moon’s repertoire flows seamlessly through a curated roster of R&B balla
 ds\, swamp rock and funky dance-floor-shaking hits. With original takes on
  beloved songs some familiar\, some delightfully refreshing – Bayou Moon
  leaves audiences energized and yearning for more. “We want people to le
 ave lighter\, happier\, more alive\,” says Mark Webb-Heims\, bass player
  and musical director. “That’s what music can do and that’s what dri
 ves Bayou Moon!”\n\nBandleader Jim Sides sought to create a band with pu
 rpose\, soul and exceptional professionalism\, resulting in a talented mix
  of unique musicians all committed to this ideal. With varying performance
  backgrounds and extensive musical experience\, this powerhouse ensemble b
 rings style\, skill and heart to every performance.
LOCATION:Spancky's Bar
URL:http://www.bayou moon.net/watch
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
