UID:260628fB_dzQaSAEKfMQXCRYytrg
DESCRIPTION:$10 General Admission\n\nDoors at 4:00pm.\n\nShow from 4:45-7:
 00pm with one intermission\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each ticket when you u
 se the code earlybird23 at checkout. Offer ends June 28th.\n\nPromo Co
 des are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, bu
 t must be typed as one word.\n\nrOnSo’s MAJN: Make a Joyful Noise!  1st
  Sunday Songwriter Sing-along @ The Lost Church in Santa Rosa\n\nrOjO n So
 Jo \\(Robert & Sonya Joseph\\) are back with a new\, different kind of sho
 w. We call it MAJN or “Make a Joyful Noise!!” This a non-religious ser
 vice\, meant to uplift the spirit and warm the heart with song and singing
 \, Singers Church will be held every 1st Sunday\, Starting July 5\, at \\(
 where else but\\) the Lost Church in Santa Rosa.\n\nHere’s the format: S
 ongwriters get 25 minutes to sing original songs and originally crafted co
 vers\, with one requirement\, … they must end their set with at least 1 
 song that the audience can sing along to. These will be the songs that pul
 l our heart strings\, make us close our eyes\, sing out loud\, fill vocal 
 harmonies\, have you smiling ear to ear. You know the songs I’m talking 
 about\; American Pie\, Piano Man\, Country Roads\, Hallelujah\, Amazing Gr
 ace\, … there are sooo many. And we all are going to raise our voices an
 d lift the ceiling with love\, positivity and song! \n\nOur First event o
 n July 5 will feature:  1\\) "Late But Ready" - Lindsey McFarland and Dre
 w Pearce 2\\) "The Rains" - Carol and Marty Rainone 3\\) Lendry Purcell an
 d Jason Greenwald 4\\) Scott Ray Laws https://www.facebook.com/MAJNSunda
 y\n\nRecommended If You Like: As a congregation of singers\, we're going t
 o Make a Joyful Noise and raise the roof in song!
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 00009KnAfMAK
