DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260706T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260706T190000
UID:260514ZMxLSI4kD0W-S5tfesRLsA
DESCRIPTION:Prost! 🍻Join us at Sebastopol Stammtisch Night- a casual Ge
 rman meet up filled with good beer\, great conversation\, and community. G
 rab a pint and pull up a chair!
LOCATION:Crooked Goat Brewing Sebastopol
URL:http://tinyurl.com/stammtischRSVP
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
