BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Tails Trail at Cuvaison Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T170000
UID:2605083emRRQw0P0SYweuZjIW6zA
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a new way to experience Cuvaison with your canine compan
 ion on the Wine Tails Trail. This self-guided vineyard walk winds just und
 er a mile through our Los Carneros estate\, with QR code stops highlightin
 g the history of our vines and winemaking. Guests begin their adventure by
  checking in with our Concierge for a map and orientation before setting o
 ff on the trail.\n\nAfter the walk\, return to the estate and enjoy a seat
 ed tasting of our current release wines\, while your pup relaxes by your s
 ide and enjoys a selection of “Barkuterie.” The Wine Tails Trail is a 
 chance to stretch your legs\, explore the vineyard\, and savor Cuvaison in
  the company of your best friend.\n\nWhen booking this experience\, please
  plan for the dog walk to begin at the time you select. The walk itself av
 erages about 45 minutes\, though you’ll also check in with our Concierge
  before and after\, as well as complete a quick waiver at the start. Your 
 wine tasting will be scheduled 60 minutes after your selected walk time\, 
 allowing a smooth transition from the trail back to your seated experience
 .\n\nGroup Size: Up to 4 guests\, including non-tasters\n\nDuration: Pleas
 e allow 120 minutes for this experience
LOCATION:Cuvaison Experience Salon\, Outdoors Only
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-tastings 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:JOOSE Rocks - Wednesday Night Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T000000
UID:260506UZ3MqdTmEk2vlqlz1x7_2Q
DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa’s Wednesday Night Market is Sonoma County’s pre
 mier street fair. Local community and visiting tourists come out in big nu
 mbers to celebrate the spirit of Sonoma County every Wednesday for 14 week
 s. With an average nightly attendance of  7\,000 – 9\,000 people Wednesd
 ay Night Market is the perfect opportunity for businesses to connect with 
 a large and local audience.\n\nCelebrating Community for 37 years on the b
 eautiful Courthouse Square in downtown Santa Rosa\, the Wednesday Night Ma
 rket Board of Directors produces this free event for the whole family. Loc
 ated 50 miles North of San Francisco in Sonoma County Wine Country the Wed
 nesday Night Market brings wine country life together in one place with th
 e finest local street foods\, sweet treats\, artists\, wellness products\,
  community non-profit groups\, exhibits and a live concert every Wednesday
 \, May through August. Guests sip local microbrews and wines as they shop 
 and take home something from our amazing variety of local artists and food
  producers selling chocolates\, tie dye\, jewelry\, candles\, teas\, cooki
 es\, crystals\, cheeses\, hummus and more. Families have fun in the Kids S
 pace and Exhibitor Area.
LOCATION:Downtown Santa Rosa
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108314719?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
