BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Camp Aleph | Summer 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T150000
UID:260318bAvOg0leCEqsZn0FpKDnQg
DESCRIPTION:Aleph is for Awesome. Aleph is for Amazing. Aleph is for #1.\n
 \nWe are delighted that you are joining us\, and we are certain that your 
 children will have a wonderful camp experience. The counselors and staff a
 t Camp Aleph are eager to greet your children with many fun and exciting p
 rograms planned for this year.\n\nCamp Aleph offers a 2-week summer progr
 am for children ages 4 through 13.\n\nCamp Aleph for girls ages 13-14.\n
