 ians will go head-to-head with the audience in a comedic twist on the clas
 sic game show. Get ready for a night of non-stop fun and entertainment as 
 our performers battle it out for fun prizes. Don't miss out on this unique
  event that guarantees laughter and good times for all!\n\n21+ Doors - 7p 
 / Show - 8p NO COVER!\n\nHosted by Casey Williams!\n\nAll your favorite So
 noma County comedians will be in the house to compete against YOU the audi
 ence\, in what will likely be the craziest game of Family Feud ever in Dow
 ntown Santa Rosa\, on a Thursday\, in July. Come out to compete and win fu
 n prizes or just watch the madness unfold.\n\nCheck in with **www.BarrelPr
 oofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
