BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Women For WineSense's Summer Grand Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T190000
UID:260701sBXjsXjgeEWOKaX0W_0lEQ
DESCRIPTION:This isn't just another wine tasting—it's THE party of the s
 ummer!\n\nJoin us for an extraordinary evening where 11 of our celebrated 
 winemakers come together for an exclusive tasting you won't want to miss!\
 n\nWhat makes this magical?\n\nSip & Savor: Taste exceptional wines from p
 owerhouse producers\n\nMeet the Makers: Get face time with the talented pe
 ople who crafted these gorgeous bottles—hear their stories\, their secre
 ts\, their passion\n\nDelicious Bites: Because great wine deserves equally
  delicious company\n\nWhy You'll Love It: Think of it as the ultimate part
 y with your wine-loving tribe—intimate conversations\, infectious laught
 er\, and that special energy that only happens when passionate people gath
 er to celebrate what they love.\n\nFeatured Winemakers and Wineries:\n\nAn
 a Diago-Draper\, Proprietor + Winemaker | Ana Diago-Draper Wines\n\nHillar
 y Sjolund\, Director of Winemaking | Aperture\n\nJulie Lumgair\, Proprieto
 r + Winemaker | Art Nouveau Wines\n\nStephanie Kunkel\, Viticulturist + Ri
 an Ervin\, Assistant Winemaker | Chappellet\n\nValentina Mendez Cortes\, A
 ssistant Viticulturist | Lambert Bridge\n\nDeb Becker\, Proprietor + Winem
 aker | Lost Valley Wines\n\nBrown Uzoechi\, Estate Sommelier | Merry Edwar
 ds\n\nPhillip Dube\, Lead Winemaker | North Coast Wine Co. / Outerbound\n\
 nBrooke Shenk\, Winemaker | St. Supéry Estate Vineyards & Winery\n\nRebek
 ah Wineburg\, Winemaker | Quintessa Winery\n\nOscar Navarro\, Winemaker | 
 Napa Valley College Winery\n\nThe Details:\n\n$40 = WWS Napa/Sonoma member
 s\n\n$40 = Students and Faculty\n\n$60 = All other guests (everyone welcom
 e—bring your crew!)\n\nNapa Valley College campus event parking included
  with your ticket\n\n🍷 Raise Your Glass! 🍷 ALL are welcome\, wine pr
 ofessionals and wine lovers\, 21+. Open to the public.\n\nWomen For WineSe
 nse vintners are hosting this outstanding GRAND TASTING in conjunction wit
 h the 47th Annual Society of Wine Educators Conference and Napa Valley Col
 lege. We're bringing together acclaimed winemakers\, SWE and WWS members\,
  NVC students\, alumni and our warmly welcome guests from the community. A
 LL wine lovers and professionals will enjoy intimate tastings\, seasonal b
 ites and conversations that connect us through the stories behind each exc
 eptional bottle.
LOCATION:Wine Education Center at Napa Valley College
URL:https://womenforwinesense.org/calendar-page-view-of-events-no-filter/#
 !event/2026/7/9/summer-grand-tasting-with-11-wineries-a-celebration-with-w
 ws-swe-and-nvc
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
