BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:GABE DURAN - ADDIE FINCH - JACK WIRTH FOPPIANO CONCERT IN THE BARN
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T210000
UID:260628UiBmS2nMXk2gczX-YqN60Q
DESCRIPTION:FOPPIANO VINEYARDS\, in association with SECRET SONG CLUB\, pr
 esents an evening of soulful indie folk in the barn featuring GABE DURAN\,
  ADDIE FINCH and JACK WIRTH.\n\n✨ All ages welcome\n\n🍷 Wines by the 
 glass or bottle available for purchase\n\n🧺 Light bites available\, pic
 nics welcome\n\n🐶 Friendly\, leashed dogs welcome\n\n🚫 No outside al
 cohol🚫 No glass containers\n\nThis is a FREE event but RSVPs are highly
  encouraged.\n\nThis show is co-presented by SECRET SONG CLUB\, an organiz
 ation that produces music parties\, songwriter showcases\, and open mics a
 t wineries and alternative venues around Sonoma County. SECRET SONG CLUB i
 s all about supporting emerging artists and creating listening spaces wher
 e people can hear music with less background chatter. Learn more at Insid
 eLands.org\n\nABOUT THE ARTISTS:\n\nGABE DURAN is a singer\, songwriter an
 d musician based in Sonoma County\, CA. With influences ranging across man
 y genres\, his vocal sounds and music stylings find much of their comfort 
 in Soul\, Blues\, and Jazz. His emotive approach to singing is as much a t
 herapeutic experience for his audiences as it is for himself. Instagram.c
 om/@gabe.duran.music\n\nADDIE FINCH is an indie-folk singer-songwriter kno
 wn for her thoughtful lyricism\, mesmerizing vocals\, and fingerstyle guit
 ar work. Her performances are elevated by the accompaniment of guitarist J
 ACK WIRTH. She is highly recommended for fans of Haley Heynderickx\, Mitsk
 i\, and Adrienne Lenker. Instagram.com/addiefinch\n\nJACK WIRTH is a guit
 arist and composer who regularly plays alongside ADDIE FINCH and many othe
 r local artists. His solo guitar and banjo work is highly recommended for 
 fans of John Fahey\, Elizabeth Cotten\, and Bill Mackay. He graduated in 2
 020 from Berklee College of Music. Instagram.com/jackqwuack. You can hear
  his solo work on Spotify (https://open.spotify.com/artist/3WcpU7804d2Me8X
 pHkXjWI).
LOCATION:Foppiano Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/foppianovineyards/event/611298/concerts-in
 -the-barn
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Parson Jones and Grace Amulet
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T193000
UID:260628DpU1fC1MSEKhqWxkQ-5q7Q
DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm.\n\nShow from 8:15-10
 :30pm with one intermission\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each ticket when you 
 use the code earlybird1 at checkout. Offer ends July 5th.\n\nPromo Cod
 es are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, but
  must be typed as one word.\n\nParson Jones is the musical project of Nort
 hern California musician/producer Kerry Conlan. Kerry describes Parson Jon
 es as nostalgic indie soul/pop/rock\, inspired by everything from Khruangb
 in and Son Little to Curtis Mayfield and Motown. \n\nIn 2014\, Parson Jon
 es released the single "Make and Model" on French label Underdog Records\,
  which has since passed 7 million plays on Spotify. In 2019\, Parson Jones
  released an album\, "Clear As Day"\, which was reviewed in Rolling Stone 
 France \\(3.5 stars!\\). In 2020\, Kerry collaborated with English musicia
 n/singer/lyricist Just Jack on the single "Flat Earth Theme”.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.instagram.com/parsonjonesmusic/ https://www.parsonjones.com https://o
 pen.spotify.com/artist/0x7rqFHFpWOBpYVJ1URgSC?si=GvYb\\_11lQeSjoMdOk7H87g\
 n\nGrace Amulet is an alt-pop singer-songwriter who has focused on recordi
 ng since 2020\, crafting dreamy\, atmospheric music rooted in emotional st
 orytelling\, vulnerability\, and introspection. Influenced by artists like
  Lana Del Rey\, Lorde\, Stevie Nicks\, and Joni Mitchell\, her sound blend
 s moody production with evocative\, vocal-driven songwriting.\n\nFor this 
 stripped-back performance\, Grace Amulet returns to the songs that first i
 nspired her to write\, alongside intimate piano-accompanied originals cent
 ered on storytelling and voice. https://www.instagram.com/graceamulet/ htt
 ps://www.facebook.com/graceamulet https://open.spotify.com/artist/3cHw9XdD
 JRTHerKYTKj9H5?si=KbwJ3ZGnTsyrCSnnQXkoZA\n\nRecommended If You Like: Lana 
 Del Rey\, Lorde\, Dijon
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 00009FC3hMAG
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
