 wn Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold stree
 t-style food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the energetic\, crowd-pl
 easing sounds of Smoke & Mirrors with the flavorful dishes of Lila’s Str
 eetside Eats.\n\nSmoke & Mirrors brings an upbeat mix of familiar favorite
 s that sets the tone for a relaxed and social evening surrounded by barrel
 s and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by the glass or bott
 le while Lila’s Streetside Eats serves fresh\, creative street food made
  to order and packed with flavor.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free ent
 ry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-
 21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a s
 eat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of great music\, great w
 ine\, and great food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live music by Smoke &
  Mirrors Food by Lila’s Streetside Eats \\(street-style comfort food\\) 
 Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healds
 burg\, CA 95448
