  preserves. The last two events may also include a produce stand.\n\nWhat 
 to bring:\n\nBring your own basket/container to help us reduce waste! If y
 ou bring wicker\, metal\, or thick plastic\, stop by the cashier before yo
 u head out to the field.\n\nWe recommend wearing sunscreen\, a hat\, and c
 omfortable shoes and bringing a water bottle.\n\nEvent details:\n\nOpen to
  the public\n\nKid & family friendly\n\nCard and tap-to-pay accepted\n\nFr
