 –2:30pm or until sold out)\n\n\\*Apple cider slushies & ice cream drizzl
 ed with our Apple Cider Syrup\n\n\\*Live soul music from Sebastopol's own
  Erica Ambrin\n\n\\*Guided orchard tours aboard our apple-themed trolley 
 ($5/person). Orchard tours depart at 11:30am\, 12pm\, 12:30pm\, 1pm\, 1:30
