BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tissue Paper Collage: Working with Value and Composition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T140000
UID:260627G-1p94-8Y0Wx-biE2eREyg
DESCRIPTION:Saturday · 1 Session\n\nDate & Time\n\nJuly 11\, 2026\n\n10:0
 0 AM – 2:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nCategory\n\nDrawing & Painting
 \, Workshops\n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nR
 egistration Cost:\n\n$75\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$10\n\nTotal Registration Co
 st:\n\n$85\n\nYou’ll begin this workshop by staining art tissue using a 
 limited palette of transparent acrylic paint\, focusing on creating a rang
 e of values from very light to very dark. Through experimentation with thr
 ee different colors you’ll create interesting\, subtle textures. Next\, 
 shapes will be cut from the tissue\, followed by working with the pieces t
 o develop composition and collage. For the final layer you’ll add marks 
 with paint\, pens \\(Micron\\)\, inks\, and stamps\, adding texture and in
 teresting effects. You will have extra sheets of tissue to take home that 
 you can use later in your collages or paintings. No prior artmaking experi
 ence required. This is a fun\, easy\, step-by-step process. All materials 
 are provided. Feel free to bring snacks or a bag lunch to eat while you wo
 rk.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/tissue-paper-collage/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:80's Outdoor Dance Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T213000
UID:260627DKxlhDqsr0COC2WIF1Etng
DESCRIPTION:Hop into your hot tub time machine and join us for a totally r
 ad outdoor 80s Dance Party at Club SCC! Get ready to dance your cares away
  under the stars as DJ StarJay spins all your favorite hits. Enjoy retro 8
 0s snacks and refreshments. Dress up encouraged\, dancing required!\n\nDat
 e & Time\n\nSaturday\, July 11\, 2026\n\n7:30 PM – 9:30 PM\n\nLocation\n
 \nBack Patio\n\nExperience Level:\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\
 nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$25\n\nClub SCC is transforming the back pati
 o into the ultimate open-air 80s dance club. Grab your friends\, bring you
 r best moves\, and let’s party like it’s 1985! DJ StarJay will spin al
 l your favorite hits from the decade of neon\, big hair\, power ballads\, 
 new wave\, pop\, punk\, and glam.Your registration includes one drink tick
 et and a selection of classic 80s-inspired snacks. Cool off with a frozen 
 margarita from the margarita machine\, enjoy an ice-cold beer\, or choose 
 from plenty of soda and nonalcoholic refreshments available throughout the
  evening. Over 21\\+ must present ID.Whether you’re channeling Madonna\,
  Prince\, Cyndi Lauper\, Miami Vice\, a Valley Girl\, a punk rocker\, or y
 our own outrageous 80s alter ego\, dress-up is highly encouraged—but not
  required. The only thing required is a willingness to hit the dance floor
 ! Think bold. Think neon. Think shoulder pads\, leg warmers\, leather jack
 ets\, lace gloves\, teased hair\, and unforgettable tunes. Kick off your 
 dancing shoes\, get footloose and fancy-free\, and join us for a night of 
 retro fun\, great music\, tasty snacks\, and plenty of laughs.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/80s-outdoor-dance-party/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
