BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SORBET Pre-Harvest Dinner at Rossi Ranch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T180000
UID:260626_MdyGxVXq0ibbud0wdJHMw
DESCRIPTION:We're delighted to celebrate the height of the growing season
  with SORBET's Summer Dinner at Rossi Ranch. Join us for an evening of con
 nection\, conversation\, and community\, with the opportunity to spend tim
 e one-on-one with local growers and producers who are shaping the future o
 f Sonoma Valley agriculture. \n\nEnjoy a thoughtfully prepared meal featu
 ring ingredients sourced from farmers committed to the health of our land\
 , our communities\, and our planet. Food will be provided and prepared by 
 Allikai Eatery’s own Chef Fiorella.Set against the backdrop of Rossi Ran
 ch's historic vineyards and organic farming practices\, the evening offers
  a chance to gather just as the precipice of the 2026 harvest season. \n\
 nTicket sales and donations will support SORBET's ongoing mission to adva
 nce  and educate on organic\, regenerative and biodynamic winegrowin
 g in Sonoma Valley. Guests will also have the opportunity to participate
  in a raffle featuring a selection of special bottles generously donated b
 y local producers. \n\nAdditional Information: 21+. Sandals and heels are
  not recommended. 10 – 15 SORBET winemakers will be present. Food and w
 ine are included with ticket price.
LOCATION:Rossi Ranch
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/sorbet-pre-harvest-dinner-at-ros
 si-ranch
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
