BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Back to Where It All Began: A 25-Year Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T170000
UID:260609jW8dk0jOIkeyfU__iGZ3dA
DESCRIPTION:For this special anniversary celebration\, we are transforming
  our Cellar Door into a throwback tasting room experience bringing it back
  to where it all began. Located in the original winemaking site\, our Cell
 ar Door holds the history\, stories\, and spirit that helped shape our win
 ery to where we are today.​\n\nStep back in time and enjoy the simple pl
 easures of wine tasting\, no frills. Just great wine\, good company\, and 
 authentic hospitality.​ Belly up to the bar and enjoy complimentary tast
 ings as we celebrate a quarter- century of shared memories\, good people\,
  and unforgettable vintages.​ Cheers to 25 years—and the many more to 
 come!​​
LOCATION:Rodney Strong Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/rodneystrong/event/610629?date=2026-07-11&
 size=1&time=12%3A00
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Evening Programs at Bothe-Napa Valley State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T220000
UID:260608MxLR8SjPwUK7b8D1ZtMUtA
DESCRIPTION:Summer Evening Programs at Bothe-Napa Valley State Park are a 
 seasonal series of family-friendly evening events hosted by Napa Valley St
 ate Parks Association and Napa County Regional Park & Open Space District.
  Held throughout June and July\, the series features a rotating lineup of 
 programs including live music\, karaoke\, outdoor movies\, trivia\, and mo
 re. Bring a chair or blanket\, roast a s'more\, and enjoy a fun evening in
  the park!
LOCATION:Bothe-Napa Valley State Park
URL:https://www.napavalleystateparks.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
