UID:260630yMpZLdGQXUeFtDMXO_t5bA
DESCRIPTION:After yet another sold-out California Theater show\, the queer
  and trans-created NIGHTMARE SHOW returns with an ALL-NEW lineup of dark v
 ariety entertainment. Producers Natasha Nightmare and Allie the Icon have 
 harvested an exceptional lineup of 9 performers from all over the Bay Area
  to bring you burlesque\, drag\, and theatrical oddities that celebrate th
 e strange and spooky. Calling all Sonoma County queers - we know you're ou
 t there\, and we've created this night of weird especially for you! Whethe
 r you're a longtime horror fan or just want to bask in the warmth of queer
  community\, Nightmare Show provides a welcoming space for all who embrace
  the darkness. Audience members are encouraged to come dressed in your com
 fiest PJs\, your darkest finery\, or whatever helps you express your inner
  demon. Featuring: Synn @synn.does.drag Mari V @marivbabyy Luna Finn @luna
 .finn Edie Eve @edieeve Redd FaFilth @reddfafilth Megnificent Lemon @megni
 ficent\\_lemon AngelTortured @angeltortured\\_cosplay Gucci Gyatt @gucci.g
 yatt Linda Lindo @lindalindoarts And our pre-show lineup of local gogo dan
