UID:260523OCUDhg88r0KFbrhg1zTi4A
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of classic blue-note jazz with the Jo
 hn Kalleen Jazz Group!\n\n**Lavender Bloom Fest Field Days:** May 23\, Ma
 y 30-31\, June 6-7\, June 13-14\, June 20\,\n\n**Lavender Sunset Evenings:
 ** May\, 29\, June 5\, June 12\, June 19\, June 26\n\n**Jazz Days:** May
  24\, June 21\, and July 12\n\n**Lavender U-Cut Experience:** June 27-28\
 , July 4-5\, July 11. Note: July 12 is also a U-Cut day\, but is listed un
 der Jazz Days.\n\nThe farm grounds are open from 10 AM to 4 PM\, and the b
 and will play from noon to 3 PM. Tacos Don Pepe will be here on all jazz d
 ays\, serving up delicious organic and locally sourced Mexican food\, with
