 dor Wynton Marsalis headlines Festival Napa Valley's *Arts for All Gala*\
 , one of the nation's premier fundraisers for education and the arts. Gues
 ts will also enjoy an artfully composed multi-course dinner by Chef Dusti
 n Valette\, chef-owner of Valette and The Matheson in Healdsburg\, each co
 urse paired with exceptional wines from Nickel & Nickel\, part of Far Nien
 te Wine Estates. Celebrity auctioneer Lydia Fenet leads the signature liv
 e auction of once-in-a-lifetime travel adventures\, bespoke performing art
 s experiences\, highly collectible wines\, and more.\n\n*Proxy bidding an
