DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Valley Players invites you to six unforgettable 
 evenings of theatre — featuring staged readings of bold\, original works
  by both veteran playwrights and emerging talents. Be the first to experie
 nce these sparkling new works brought to life!\n\n**June 14:** *Mother\, I
  Could Kill You* by Barbara A. Silverstone\n\n**June 28:** A Night of One-
 Acts\n\n*When We Ceased to Be?* by Jack Bushnell\n\n*At Midspan on the And
 y Warhol* by Kirk Johnson\n\n**July 12:** *Waldorf School* by Nate Currier
 \n\n**July 26:** *Deadly Pursuits* by Lorraine Midanik\n\n**August 9:** A 
 Night of Shorts\n\n*Madam Director* by Gary A. Davis\n\n*Date Night* by Ba
 rbara A. Silverstone\n\n*Table in the Air* by Rex McGregor\n\n*An Empowere
 d Woman* by Barbara Anderson\n\n**August 23:** *Night Shift* by Mack Wrigh
 t\n\nEach play will be followed by a short talk-back.\n\nBuy tickets onlin
 e and save $3 off the at the door price! Tickets can be pre-purchased onli
 ne or by calling 707-948-6273 for $12 or purchased at the door beginning 3
 0 minutes before showtime for $15.
LOCATION:NVEF Discovery Campus
