DESCRIPTION:The Beer Scouts are a Northern California power trio that defi
 nes raw rock & roll: guitar\, bass\, drums… and someone screaming over i
 t!\n\nFeaturing Rob Ruiz \\(bass/vocals\\)\, Howard Vatcher \\(guitar/voca
 ls\\)\, and Ken Susan \\(drums/vocals\\)\, they play original rock music a
 s well as blues and straight-ahead rock & roll influenced by the Beatles\,
  ZZ Top\, Chuck Berry\, and even the Monkees!\n\nwww.beerscoutsband.com\n\
 nPerched on the edge of a small lake with a sprawling outdoor space\, we s
 erve up craft cocktails and delicious food - all with a side of sunshine a
 nd good company.\n\nwww.thewaterhawk.com
