 he next level? This 6-week salsa intermediate Marin series is designed for
  dancers who already know the basics \\(timing\, basic steps\, and simple 
 turns\, etc.\\) and want to build the confidence and versatility to shine 
 on the social dance floor.\n\nIn this class\, you’ll:\n\nDevelop adaptab
 ility so you can flow with different partners and music.\n\nRefine your fo
 otwork and styling for sharper expression.\n\nMaster more complex turn pat
 terns and combinations.\n\nStrengthen your lead and follow for smoother\, 
 more connected dancing.\n\nWhat to Expect: Steven’s teaching style blend
 s structure with fun\, creating a supportive space where you’ll be chall
 enged but never overwhelmed. Each week builds on the last\, helping you pr
 ogress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n\nDetail
 s:\n\nNo partner necessary — rotations ensure everyone gets to dance.\n\
 nPlease wear non-marking shoe soles to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 m
 inutes early to warm up and get settled.\n\nDate & Time: Wednesdays @ 7:15
 PM – 8:15PM\n\nInstructor: Steven Khuong\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highwa
 y \\#8 San Rafael\, CA
