 un for all ages on Thursday\, July 16\, from 4:00 to 8:00 p.m. at The C
 rooked Goat in Sebastopol.\n\nHosted at one of Sonoma County's favorite g
 athering spots\, Bachan's Day is a free community celebration featuring co
 mplimentary food and beverages\, live entertainment\, exciting giveaways\,
  and prizes throughout the evening. Whether you're a longtime fan of Bacha
 n's or simply looking for a fun summer outing\, everyone is welcome to att
 end.\n\nGuests can enjoy:\n\nFree food and drinks\n\nLive music\n\nGiveawa
 ys and prizes\n\nA casual\, family-friendly atmosphere\n\nBachan's Day cel
 ebrates community\, great flavors\, and bringing people together over deli
 cious food and good times.
