 \n\nBring your partner\, your kids\, or come on your own for an afternoon 
 of fun with beer\, wine\, snacks\, cornhole\, arts and crafts\, and more. 
 Tickets on us!\n\nThis community appreciation day is our way of celebratin
 g you - our members\, neighbors\, and the broader Healdsburg community tha
 t makes this town so special. After refreshments and activities\, we'll wa
 lk together to the Prune Packers game and continue celebrating the spirit 
 of Healdsburg and our stellar baseball team. Tickets to the game are on us
  - please make sure to RSVP in advance.
LOCATION:CraftWork Healdsburg
URL:https://prune-packers-pregame.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
