SUMMARY:Learn to Make Ceviche from Scratch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T140000
UID:260627c2S_s1LqUEyBv_QZMK_-xw
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, July 18 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 12:00 PM\n\nLocation\n
 \nRoom 109\, Rotary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nCulinary Arts\n\nExperience Lev
 el\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$100\n\n
 Materials Fee:\n\nAll Materials Provided\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$1
 00\n\nJoin instructor Gerardo Diaz for a hands-on class built around the b
 right\, refreshing flavors of ceviche. You’ll learn how to select the fr
 eshest seafood\, balance the citrus marinade that “cooks” it to perfec
 tion\, and bring everything together with the right herbs\, aromatics\, an
 d finishing touches. Gerardo will share the techniques and tips that make 
 this dish a standout\, whether you’re serving it as an appetizer or the 
 centerpiece of a meal. Perfect for cooks of every level\, you’ll leave w
 ith a fresh skill set and the confidence to recreate it at home. Sign up t
 oday and bring your appetite to the Sonoma Community Center.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/learn-to-make-ceviche-from-
 scratch/
