BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Why We Live Here Music & Arts Fest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T183000
UID:260607m2zPUv7iA0eB_M5acN7hwg
DESCRIPTION:Why We Live Here Musics & Arts Fest\n\nJoin us for the 3rd Ann
 ual Why We Live Here Music & Arts Fest\, a celebration of the music\, crea
 tivity\, food\, wine\, and community that make Sonoma County such a specia
 l place to call home.\n\nSet among the vineyards at Hook & Ladder Winery\,
  this annual festival brings together an outstanding lineup of regional mu
 sicians\, local artisans\, food vendors\, and wine lovers for an unforgett
 able afternoon in the Russian River Valley. Spend the day discovering new 
 artists\, exploring local makers\, enjoying great food\, and sharing a bot
 tle of wine with friends while surrounded by the beauty of wine country.\n
 \nThis year’s lineup features a diverse mix of acclaimed singer-songwrit
 ers\, bands\, and performers whose music perfectly complements a day spent
  outdoors.\n\nFeatured Performers\n\nBenjamin Andrews & The Success Ensemb
 le\n\nAnna Ash\n\nJason Beard’s Bring Joy\n\nOona & The Good Band\n\nFoo
 d & Extras\n\nFresh wood-fired pizza from our outdoor oven\n\nFeatured foo
 d vendors\n\nLocal artists and makers\n\nHook & Ladder wines available by 
 the glass and bottle\n\nFamily-friendly atmosphere\n\nLawn and picnic seat
 ing available \\(blankets and chairs encouraged\\)\n\nAdmission\n\nPresale
  Tickets: $30\n\nGather your friends\, bring a blanket\, and join us for a
  day of music\, art\, wine\, and community as we celebrate everything that
  makes Sonoma County a place we love to call home.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/why-we-live-here-music-arts-
 fest-2026
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
