BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:4th Annual Valley Car Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T150000
UID:260314SIAucsU0O0SRgzCo6Td9FA
DESCRIPTION:The San Geronimo Valley Community Center is thrilled to annou
 nce the 4th Annual Valley Car Show\, rolling into a brand-new location 
 this year! Join us on Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\, from 11:00 AM to 3:00 P
 M at the Woodacre Improvement Club for a full day of classic cars\, com
 munity spirit\, live music\, and family fun.\n\nThis year’s show promise
 s something for everyone. Enjoy live music from Wreckless Strangers\, sip
  local craft beer from Fairfax Brew Co.\, and wines from JD Ranch and Vi
 neyards. Delicious food vendors will be on site\, along with Silver Shave
  Ice\, a Family & Kids Activity Zone\, and more festivities throughout the
  day.\n\nCar enthusiasts can look forward to an impressive lineup of vehic
 les competing for Sponsor Choice Awards\, selected by our event sponsors\
 , as well as the coveted Valley Community–Voted Best in Show Award.\n\n
 Event Schedule\n\n 9:00–10:30 AM – Car Show Registrant Check-In\n\nT
 railered cars must be unloaded at the show site. Trucks and trailers must 
 be moved off-site to Dickson Ranch. Shuttle available between Dickson Ranc
 h and the Woodacre Improvement Club\n\n11:00 AM – Festivities Begin\n\n
 11:30 AM – Live Music with Wreckless Strangers\n\n1:00 PM – Sponsor 
 Choice Awards\n\n2:45 PM – Valley Community–Voted Best in Show Announ
 cement\n\n3:00 PM – Closing Parade along Railroad Avenue\n\nAdmission i
 s FREE to the public\, so bring your friends\, family\, and fellow car lo
 vers for a lively day celebrating community\, craftsmanship\, and the art 
 of the classic\, vintage\, antique and unique Car in the heart of the Vall
 ey.
LOCATION:Woodacre Improvement Club
URL:https://sgvperformingarts.eventcalendarapp.com/2026-valley-car-show-2
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sol Horizon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T000000
UID:260312L2KhazdVDUWA4_sZFMnkDQ
DESCRIPTION:The Bob Marley Tribute by Sol Horizon returns to the outdoor s
 tage in the beer garden at HopMonk Tavern Sebastopol on SATURDAY\, JULY 18
 TH!\n\nSol Horizon has been Sonoma County\, California’s best reggae ban
 d and Northern California’s premier Bob Marley tribute band. The band wa
 s voted “Best Band” in the North Bay Bohemian’s “Best of the North
  Bay” Reader’s Picks in 2022 and 2023 and awarded the NorBay Award for
  “Best Reggae Band” in the North Bay 9 times\, including the last 5 ye
 ars in a row and 8 of the previous 9 years. Their renowned Bob Marley trib
 ute pays homage to the global voice of reggae\, celebrating his life and l
 egacy through performances of his greatest music. The tribute expands from
  an 8-piece original music band to a 12-piece featuring an additional keyb
 oardist\, female background vocalist\, and 2 horns. The band continues to 
 expand its offering of Bob Marley classics\, from well-known chart-toppers
  to more rare cuts and versions\, mixing in subtle musical interpretations
  and blazing solos to keep the crowd on its toes. Don’t miss this tribut
 e to the worldwide voice of reggae music!
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107935942?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
