UID:260206Ov2k73KgJU-VhKu4T-ewWA
DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a ta
 sting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acr
 oss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll 
 and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new so
 unds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**Pepper On The Run**\n\nThe 
 **Pepper On The Run** band is a tribute to the music of Sir Paul McCartne
 y from The Beatles\, Wings and early solo songs! Pepper On The Run plays a
 ll of his greatest music\, while leaving out the ones that are too schmalt
 zy (No “Silly Love Songs” I “Say Say Say” here). One fan calls the
 m\, “Beatles with balls!” They’re based in the San Francisco Bay Are
 a.\n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends
  to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and
  family friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/event/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
