UID:260630Lcbl0ziOYEy8Nf5QgXgmNQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a hike at The Sea Ranch Lodge Farm\, which lies on
  a sunny western slope just 2 minutes south of the Lodge. Traverse century
 -old logging roads through lush riparian zones\, open rangelands with coas
 tal views\, and serene silvopasture. The 1.5-mile trail includes a 400-foo
 t elevation gain — and a scenic descent back down.\n\nBring sturdy shoes
  and water for this rewarding trek through The Sea Ranch’s diverse lands
 capes! Note: Steep sections may be challenging for those with mobility lim
 itations. Due to safety considerations\, dogs are not permitted.\n\n\\*Max
  25 guests\, ages 7+
