BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Valley of the Moon Music Festival: In Shadow & Song (Concert 4)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T180000
UID:2606194dJpPa2RzkuKxxER9t96Uw
DESCRIPTION:Experience an afternoon of evocative chamber music inspired by
  Dvořák’s travels to Russia at the invitation of Tchaikovsky. This ric
 hly expressive program explores a vibrant musical world through works by A
 rensky\, Dvořák\, Mussorgsky\, and the long-overlooked composer Yuliya W
 eissberg. Concert duration: approximately 2 hours with intermission.\n\nTh
 e Valley of the Moon Music Festival returns July 11–26\, 2026\, with Pos
 tcards from Dvořák\, a season inspired by the travels\, influences\, and
  cultural connections behind the composer’s music. Set in the heart of S
 onoma Valley\, the festival brings together internationally acclaimed musi
 cians for historically informed performances that blend world-class classi
 cal music with the beauty and charm of wine country.
LOCATION:Hanna Center Auditorium
URL:https://valleyofthemoonmusicfestival.org/event/russia-in-shadow-song/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
