BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:La Fête Zazou: A Cabaret Jazz and French Culinary Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T180000
UID:260603qUO1qGuBDkuyZXN_mi5K8A
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable afternoon and early evening of mu
 sic and French cuisine in honor of Bastille Day\, and our friendship with 
 the people of France\, French immigrants\, and their descendants on Sunday
 \, July 19\, 2026. The Ranch at Sonoma Mountain and Bodega Bay Oyster Comp
 any invite the community to enjoy a French cabaret jazz concert while savo
 ring French appetizers\, oysters\, a four-course meal\, and French wines.\
 n\nSeating will be outside in an intimate setting at **Bodega Bay Oyster C
 ompany** where guests will enjoy a seasonal French menu highlighting ingre
 dients from the Ranch at Sonoma Mountain\, oysters from Bodega Bay Oyster 
 Company\, and carefully selected products from local artisans. Attendees w
 ill be transported to the 1920-1940s cabaret jazz scene in Paris with sing
 er **Laurent Fourgo** performing his sweet jazzy sound and some added juke
  box favorites\; special guest vocalist **Isabelle Fontaine** will captiva
 te with her rich melodies in a soulful Gypsy style. The band includes powe
 r house instrumentalists Jeff Sanford on horns\, Simon Planting on bass\, 
 Karen Kusanovich on percussion\, and Jeff Magidson on guitar.  \n\nGuests
  are encouraged to dress in Cabaret style attire with fun prizes going to 
 the best dressed couple and best dressed table. \n\nWe also welcome atten
 dees to join us in the morning at either of two optional event additions. 
 Enjoy the beauty of Tomales Bay\, learn about oyster farming\, and enjoy a
  delicious bowl of bouillabaisse and other delectables from 8:00 AM – 11
 :00 AM at Marshall\, Tomales Bay.\n\n**Option 1**:   Self-guided hike\,
  oyster farm tour\, and brunch on a private beach.\n\n**Option 2**:  Two 
 hour guided kayak tour by Point Reyes Adventure Company\, oyster farm tour
 \, and brunch on a private beach
LOCATION:Bodega Bay Oyster Company
URL:https://www.sonomamtn.com/event-details/la-fete-zazou
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
