BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Brandlin Estate Wine & Food Tasting Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T160000
UID:2603122HAPxL1Nn0SXvEa1_gpmfw
DESCRIPTION:Born on the rugged slopes of Mount Veeder\, Brandlin Estate pr
 oduces wines of structure\, intensity\, and place. The Brandlin Experience
  offers an in-depth exploration of this historic vineyard site through a c
 urated tasting of five estate-grown wines—including Zinfandel from centu
 ry-old vines and the estate’s signature Cabernet Sauvignon. This seated\
 , guided experience invites guests to delve into the mountain terroir thro
 ugh the lens of small-lot winemaking. Each wine reflects the elevation\, e
 xposure\, and rocky soils that define the Brandlin Estate. For an added di
 mension\, guests may opt to include seasonal bites\, thoughtfully paired t
 o complement the structure and complexity of the wines. This experience is
  hosted at the picturesque Boathouse.
LOCATION:Cuvaison Tasting Salon (Indoors Only)
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/the-brandlin-estate-win
 e-food-tasting-experience/18318441/2026-07-22T11
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Big Stage Karaoke Wednesdays with KJ Danny D
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T013000
UID:26012598nyre4B80S88hPwLAWEZg
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday nights at Barrel Proof Lounge just got louder\, sexi
 er\, and way more fun.\n\nKaraoke moves to the main showroom big stage eve
 ry Wednesday at 9pm\, following Open Mic\, and runs until late. Hosting th
 e night is KJ Danny D (Danny Duclos)—one of the most popular and in-dema
 nd karaoke hosts around. We’re genuinely stoked to have him bringing his
  style\, energy\, and crowd-moving presence to Downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nThi
 s isn’t sleepy bar karaoke. Danny brings a fresh\, high-energy approach 
 that turns singing into a full-on late-night experience. Big stage\, great
  sound\, packed room\, and the kind of momentum that keeps people singing 
 well past closing time.\n\nMain showroom  Starts 9pm (after Open Mic)  N
 o cover  Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nCheck out **www.barrelprooflounge.com**
  for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/big-stage-karaoke-wednesdays-with-kj-dann
 y-d-tickets-1981510993723?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
