 ls Fee:\n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nProgram overview\n\n
 Deborah Donahower takes you through the fundamentals of working with clay 
 in on the wheel in this 8 week course. Designed for all levels \\(beginner
