BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Last Gift Box Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T143000
UID:260519IAoaFKfOH0S1t9W3HEChxg
DESCRIPTION:A workshop for all ages with Tina Cole Kreitz\n\nWhat would it
  mean to leave clarity instead of confusion? Peace instead of uncertainty?
  The Last Gift Box workshop offers practical guidance for organizing impor
 tant papers\, making medical decisions\, communicating wishes to loved one
 s\, and reflecting on how we want to be remembered.\n\nFacilitator Tina Co
 le Kreitz brings decades of experience\, compassion\, humor\, and wisdom t
 o this deeply human conversation about living and dying well.\n\nAuthor of
  “The Last Gift Box\, A Present to those who follow me”\, since 2013 T
 ina has presented numerous workshops to faith and community groups on the 
 tremendous gift this book represents and used it in her own personal life.
  A former educator with a degree in Sociology and a Master’s degree in C
 linical Psychology\, Tina approaches her subject with a mix of compassion 
 and humor.\n\nThe Last Gift Box is your guide to decide how you wish to li
 ve and die\, how to organize your papers\, make medical decisions and how 
 you would like to be remembered. Tina is your guide and support in this pr
 ocess. This workshop provides tricks to getting the work done\, meet other
 s committed to completing their gift and share how best to communicate you
 r wishes to your family and friends.\n\nTina Cole Kreitz’s vision: “I 
 am here to help anyone who is going to die. I help all of you get your lif
 e in order and guide you as you decide how you wish to die\, where you wis
 h to die and how you want to be remembered.  This is challenging work but
  doable. If you don't make decisions now\, while you can\, I know from the
  experience of being part of six friends' deaths in our 40's\, you cannot 
 expect family and friends to know what you want. I am your guide\, your su
 pport. It is my mission to help you avoid the confusion\, fear\, anger\, d
 isbelief I felt when our friends died.  I want you to die free of fear an
 d in peace\, content\, knowing you gave your loved ones the best Last Gift
 .” Learn more at www.lastgiftbox.com
LOCATION:St. Columba's Inverness
URL:https://www.stcolumbasinverness.org/last-gift-box
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
