UID:260606fleR8Y1QfE2HNH-kL1KZdg
DESCRIPTION:Hear the remarkable 2026 Cremona Foundation Apprentices in one
  of the season’s most exciting concerts. Featuring young musicians at pi
 votal moments in their artistic journeys\, this showcase offers audiences 
 a chance to experience extraordinary emerging talent up close. Stay after 
 the concert for a casual reception and an opportunity to meet the performe
 rs. Concert duration: approximately 2 hours with intermission.\n\nThe Vall
 ey of the Moon Music Festival returns July 11–26\, 2026\, with Postcards
  from Dvořák\, a season inspired by the travels\, influences\, and cultu
 ral connections behind the composer’s music. Set in the heart of Sonoma 
 Valley\, the festival brings together internationally acclaimed musicians 
 for historically informed performances that blend world-class classical mu
 sic with the beauty and charm of wine country.
