SUMMARY:Dumpling Workshop with Lani Chan at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T130000
UID:260627bfpvIvrMOUmcYikEWscjqQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 3-hour hands-on dumpling workshop led by Lani Ch
 an\, founder of Hei Ma\, where you'll learn to make dumplings entirely fro
 m scratch — wrappers\, fillings\, and all. You'll start by making the do
 ugh. From there\, you'll form and cook vegetarian dumplings\, learn to mak
 e scallion pancakes\, and pair everything with Hei Ma chili crisp and a sp
 ecial dipping sauce made with Gold Ridge Organic Farms Apple Cider Balsami
 c Vinegar.\n\nThe experience begins with a ride aboard our apple-themed tr
 olley out to the Apple Cottage\, where the class will take place surrounde
 d by the beauty of the farm. Each guest will receive an apple-blossom pink
  apron to take home and enjoy a refreshing citrus shrub alongside their fr
 eshly made dumplings. Whether you're a seasoned home cook or a first-time 
 dumpling maker\, this is an experience you won't forget — good food\, gr
 eat company\, and a deeper connection to the ingredients grown right here 
 in Sonoma County.\n\nLani Chan is the co-founder of Hei Ma (formerly known
  as Big Spoon Sauce Co.)\, a Sonoma County-based small-batch sauce brand r
 ooted in Chinese culinary tradition and peak-season California produce. Wh
 at began as a chili crisp project in a Brooklyn apartment in 2019 has grow
 n into a community-driven food brand celebrated for its bold flavors and c
 ultural heart.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/610522/dump
 ling-making-workshop-with-lani-chan
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Judas Thieves - tribute to Judas Priest - and more on July 25 in S
 anta Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T220000
UID:2606278pQEfe9xv0q10FXm1z6rAQ
DESCRIPTION:Rock out with Judas Thieves (Judas Priest tribute)\, Electric 
 Funeral (Black Sabbath tribute) and Crossroads of Cream (Cream tribute)\n\
 nIt's rock-n-roll and metal nirvana as tribute bands for Judas Priest\, Bl
 ack Sabbath and Cream converge for ONE NIGHT at Barrel Proof Lounge! Get y
 our metal on all night long!\n\n• Judas Thieves are a popular Judas Prie
 st tribute band based out of Northern Nevada and the Lake Tahoe/Reno regio
 n. They frequently tour the West Coast and perform heavy metal hits like "
 Breaking the Law" and "The Ripper" • Electric Funeral This Ultimate OZZY
  Sabbath era band formed in 2001. Driven by his love for.Tony Iommi.. and 
 ..Black Sabbath..\, ..Electric Funeral.. was the vision of Heavy Metal gui
 tarist Tim Graham. But the man who once met ..Ozzy.. on a sidewalk in L.A.
  did not guess that his efforts to recruit band members would turn up ..Sk
 itzo.. front man\, ..Lance Ozanix..\, a veteran ..Ozzy.. impersonator sinc
 e 1988. 2012 Bassist is Dave Delicio of Holy-Role-model and Gweedo the Kil
 ler Pimp.. hired former ..Outrage.. and ..Ashen Idol.. drummer\, ..Liz Say
 . • Crossroads of Cream The Crossroads of Cream band is a tribute to the
  music of the band Cream and early Eric Clapton\, (such as Blind Faith\, D
 erek and the Dominoes and John Mayall’s Bluesbreakers). They’re based 
 in the San Francisco Bay Area\, where the original Cream had their breakou
 t shows at the famous Fillmore and Winterland auditoriums!\n\nThis is the 
 3rd band of this kind for lead vocalist/guitarist Tony Lemieux. Coming int
 o the fold for this\, 3rd time’s a charm version are: Ian Luke on drums\
 , Stu Dahlquist on guitars/vocals\, Peter Lomenzo on bass and Gary Schlosb
 erg on keyboards. DON'T WAIT! Get your tickets and rock out!\n\n21+ Doors 
 @6:30 / Show @7:30 $15adv / $20door\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.c
 om** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/judas-thieves-tribute-to-judas-priest-and
 -more-on-july-25-in-santa-rosa-tickets-1991730624915?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
