BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:D.A.M FUN WINE TASTING
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T170000
UID:260611jJcnfWizOk-2bkGk-6YU-w
DESCRIPTION:**D.A.M. Fun Tasting** **Dan Kosta • Adam Lee • Morét Bre
 alynn**\n\nJoin Dan\, Adam\, and Morét for a lively afternoon of great wi
 ne\, candid conversation\, behind-the-scenes stories\, and more than a few
  strong Pinot Noir opinions.\n\nThroughout the tasting\, each host will ta
 ke a turn in the **D.A.M. Hot Seat**\, answering unscripted questions from
  the other two — and from the audience. Wine\, business\, vineyards\, tr
 avel\, successes\, failures\, and stories that may or may not have been to
 ld before are all fair game.\n\nEnjoy a selection of wines\, light bites\,
  plenty of laughs\, and an afternoon with three friends who have spent the
 ir careers shaping the wine world.\n\n**Saturday\, July 25** **2:00 PM –
  5:00 PM** **Grand Cru Custom Crush | Windsor\, CA** **Tickets: $25**\n\nC
 ome thirsty. Bring your questions. Get ready for a **D.A.M. Fun** afternoo
 n.
LOCATION:Grand Cru Custom Crush
URL:https://moretbrealynnwines.com/wine/damfuntasting
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
