BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TAKE YOUR TIME: Oil Pintings by Sharon Eisley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260727T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260727T170000
UID:260529o4X0FnBXK0mPobKS5KEQAA
DESCRIPTION:“Take Your Time”\n\nChange and transformation take time. I
 n her newest oil paintings Sharon Eisley explores the time as a process. B
 e it moving through grief\, re-framing your story of self\, or birthing so
 me new creation\, each painting lures you in with beautiful application th
 en holds you in time for a closer examination of our human experience. Eis
 ley's paintings are all inspired by tarot cards and her personal journey. 
 Tarot readings will be offered at the reception by @SymbolWarehouse for an
  optional small donation.\n\nOur guest artist\, Robert Benson\, will be ch
 allenging your eyes to fill in the details with his impressionist watercol
 ors.\n\nThis June 20th reception will be the FINAL art opening for Sebasto
 pol Gallery in its home of almost 20 years! This show may last only throug
 h June 2026\, then move to our new location. Or it may be up through June 
 and July. Either way\, this will be your last chance to come celebrate our
  local\, amazing group of artists at 150 N Main St.. “Take Your Time” 
 is a reminder to our collective to take our time finding and setting up ou
 r new home for all of you. I hope you can all come celebrate all the time 
 and art we shared with you in our lovely gallery.\n\nwww.sharoneisley.com
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Olympics Camp - Sonoma Gymnastics Academy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260727T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260727T143000
UID:260514te30wDTa_0aSPaWdfCBIUg
DESCRIPTION:Make the most of summer with award-winning Gymnastics Camps at
  SGA! Keep children’s bodies and brains active with careful guidance fro
 m our trained instructors\, and have some fun\, too. We’ll play in our o
 utdoor inflatable water parks\, eat lunch in the park\, and learn basic gy
 mnastics techniques every day from 8:30 AM - 2:30 PM. Each week has its ow
 n unique theme with specialized crafts\, games\, activities\, and learning
 . Enroll in one week\, a few\, or all ten! Sign up on our site\, email us\
 , or call us to register. Spots are limited.\n\n**\\-This week’s theme i
 s: OLYMPICS WEEK!-**\n\n*Get ready to flip into fun at our Olympics-themed
  camp week. Campers will dive into the world of Gymnastics by learning ski
 lls and playing games. Try out tons of different events featured in the ac
 tual Olympics with the help of our trained staff. Engage in the history of
  the Olympics\, get creative with crafts\, get exercise\, and make new fri
 ends all in our safe\, friendly environment.*\n\nCamps are best suited for
  children ages 4 to 12. All participants must be fully toilet-trained.\n\n
 Students should wear a t-shirt with elastic waistband shorts/pants\, or a 
 leotard. Long hair must be pulled back. No jewelry\, jeans\, dresses\, or 
 skirts. Please wear or pack clothing layers for if the weather permits us 
 to adventure outside!\n\nPlease pack your child(ren) a PEANUT-FREE lunch\,
  water bottle\, and comfortable shoes. Morning snacks will be provided.
LOCATION:Sonoma Gymnastics Academy
URL:https://sonomagymnasticsacademy.com/camps/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
